🏥 MedViz AI

MedViz AI is an interactive healthcare data visualization and analysis web application built using Streamlit. It allows users to upload datasets, generate insightful visualizations, perform basic risk predictions, and query data using natural language.

🚀 Features
📤 Data Upload
Upload healthcare datasets in CSV format
Preview data instantly in a table
📊 Advanced Visualization
Multiple chart types:
Bar Chart
Countplot
Pie Chart
Histogram
Line Chart
Dynamic column selection
Download charts as PNG
Easy sharing of visual outputs
🤖 AI Risk Prediction

Predict disease risk using:

Age
Sugar Level
Gender

Outputs:

Low Risk ✅
Medium Risk ⚡
High Risk ⚠️
📈 Automated Insights

Detects:

Average Age
Most Common Disease
Sugar Level trends
Gender distribution

Generates quick summaries for better decision-making.

💬 NLP Query System

Ask simple questions like:

"Show age distribution"
"Most common disease"
"Gender stats"

Automatically generates charts or results.

🛠️ Tech Stack
Python
Streamlit
Pandas
Matplotlib
Seaborn
